OL,3,GNEWSAPC who called person a 'rat'
OL,4,Aguilty of misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who called a member of
OL,7,Fthe public a "rat" and was
OL,8,F"controlling" towards a female
OL,9,Fcolleague committed gross misconduct,
OL,10,Fpolice bosses have ruled.
OL,12,FPC Rifat Khan, who resigned from
OL,13,FLeicestershire Police before the
OL,14,Fhearing on Monday, made the "rat"
OL,15,Fcomment while attending an anti-social
OL,16,Fbehaviour report on 18 November last
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
