OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPC who called person a 'rat'
OL,4,Aguilty of misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz Briggs, representing the force,
OL,7,Fadded that despite a female colleague
OL,8,Fmaking it clear she wanted to maintain
OL,9,Fa "professional relationship" with
OL,10,FKhan, he would "continue to ask her
OL,11,Fout", "attend her breaks" at work and
OL,12,F"make her uncomfortable".
OL,14,FThe hearing was told Khan had also made
OL,15,Fhighly derogatory comments towards
OL,16,Fother colleagues.
